cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it using the metadata below."
title: "DIEF-MO: A Standardized Data Integration and Encoding Framework for Multi-Omics Data with Lineage Tracking"
abstract: >-
  DIEF-MO (Data Integration and Encoding Framework for Multi-Omics) is a
  standardized framework that combines data encoding, unique identifiers, and
  lineage tracking to produce traceable, interoperable, and AI-ready multi-omics
  datasets.
